        "summary": "Seven Phase 1 source files were read in full. project/src/context.js exports a single named constant FTM_CONTEXT (namespace prefixes only). The three entity factories \u00e2\u20ac\u201d createTaskDefinition(params), createTaskInstance(params), createUser(params) \u00e2\u20ac\u201d are named ESM exports that return JSON-LD objects; createReminderEvent(sentAt, deliveryStatus) differs in taking positional arguments and omitting '@context' from its return value. Both validator functions \u00e2\u20ac\u201d validateTaskDefinition(td) and validateTaskInstance(ti) \u00e2\u20ac\u201d return { valid, errors[] }; validateTaskDefinition enforces six rules with a documented TODO deferring the assignedTo role check to Phase 4 (Operator decision I10); validateTaskInstance enforces only two rules (dueAt validity and clientSequence positivity). package.json declares ESM module type and a single test command (node --test tests/phase1.test.js) with no declared dependencies. All entity factories that include @id use globalThis.crypto.randomUUID() without polyfill; reminderEvent returns no @id and no @context.",
