          "SPEC \u00c2\u00a74.5 RecurrenceMaterializer deduplicates by `taskDefinition @id` + `dueAt`, but `createTaskInstance` stores `dueAt` nested as `{ '@type': 'xsd:dateTime', '@value': dueAt }`. Does the deduplication logic need to compare against `ftm:dueAt['@value']` specifically?",
