            "claim": "The deduplication key in recurrenceMaterializer is the string `taskDefId + '|' + dueAt`, constructed from `inst['ftm:taskDefinition']` (the taskDef `@id` string) and `inst['ftm:dueAt']['@value']` (the ISO-8601 string from the JSON-LD value object), stored in a `Set`.",
