          {
            "id": "F6",
            "claim": "recurrenceMaterializer applies four ordered skip/filter conditions before pushing a candidate to `toCreate`: (1) non-recurring taskDefs are skipped via `continue`; (2) taskDefs whose `scheduleComputer` result has a truthy `['ftm:error']` property are skipped via `continue`; (3) candidates whose composite key already exists in `existingKeys` are silently skipped (dedup, no counter increment); (4) candidates where `catchUpPolicy === 'current-only'` AND `dueAt < currentTime` are skipped with `skipped++`.",
            "evidence": [
