            "claim": "SPEC \u00c2\u00a75 defines a `StateAdapter` TypeScript interface with three entity namespaces (`saveTaskDefinition`/`getTaskDefinition`/`listTaskDefinitions`, `saveTaskInstance`/`getTaskInstance`/`listTaskInstances`, `saveUser`/`getUser`/`listUsers`), all methods returning `Promise<...>`.",
