            "claim": "SPEC \u00c2\u00a75.1 mandates a last-writer-wins conflict resolution policy for `saveTaskDefinition` and `saveTaskInstance` when an entity with the same `@id` already exists: higher `ftm:clientSequence` wins; on tie, later `ftm:updatedAt` wins; on full tie the incoming entity wins.",
            "evidence": [
