                "excerpt": "1. Load the existing entity. 2. Compare ftm:clientSequence. The entity with the higher clientSequence wins. 3. If sequences are equal, compare ftm:updatedAt. The entity with the later timestamp wins. 4. If both are equal, the incoming entity wins (idempotent re-save is safe). 5. The losing entity is discarded; the winning entity is stored."
              }
            ],
            "kind": "observation"
          },
